sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student (web UI)
    actor TU as Tutor (web UI)
    actor AD as Admin (web UI)
    participant G as API Gateway (Traefik)
    participant A as Auth
    participant B as Booking
    participant R as Review
    participant T as Tutor
    participant Q as RabbitMQ
    participant N as Notification

    Note over S,N: REST = solid arrow, gRPC = labelled "gRPC", event = labelled "AMQP", local DB step = note box

    rect rgb(255, 244, 230)
    Note over S,R: Phase 1 · Student reviews a completed lesson
    S->>G: REST POST /api/bookings/{id}/review (rating, text, Idempotency-Key)
    G->>A: REST forward-auth: verify session and STUDENT capability
    A-->>G: signed actor assertion
    G->>R: REST request + actor assertion + gateway credential
    R->>B: gRPC getReviewEligibility (booking id)
    B-->>R: owner, tutor, subject, completedAt, eligible
    R->>A: gRPC lookupAccounts (student display name)
    A-->>R: display name
    Note over R: Local DB transaction (MongoDB review_db):<br/>one review per booking, insert review PUBLIC,<br/>save idempotent operation result
    R-->>S: 201 review (PUBLIC at once, no admin approval)
    end

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over TU,R: Phase 2 · Tutor replies once
    TU->>G: REST POST /api/reviews/{id}/reply (If-Match, Idempotency-Key)
    G->>A: REST forward-auth (TUTOR capability)
    G->>R: REST request + actor assertion
    Note over R: Local DB transaction: review belongs to this tutor,<br/>is PUBLIC, has no reply, revision matches,<br/>save reply and bump revision
    alt Reply saved
        R-->>TU: 200 review with reply
    else Already replied or revision changed
        R-->>TU: 409 REPLY_EXISTS or 412 REVISION_MISMATCH
    end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 236, 236)
    Note over S,R: Phase 3 · Flag a review
    S->>G: REST POST /api/reviews/{id}/flags (reason, Idempotency-Key)
    G->>R: REST request + actor assertion (after forward-auth)
    Note over R: Local DB transaction: review is PUBLIC,<br/>one flag per reporter, insert flag OPEN,<br/>bump revision, outbox row review.flagged
    alt First flag by this user
        R-->>S: 201 flag
    else Same user flags again
        R-->>S: 409 FLAG_EXISTS
    end
    end

    rect rgb(243, 235, 255)
    Note over AD,N: Phase 4 · Admin moderates (KEEP, HIDE or REMOVE)
    R-)Q: AMQP publish review.flagged (outbox worker, target ADMINS)
    Q-)N: AMQP deliver event
    Note over N: Dedupe, create admin notification job (simulated delivery)
    AD->>G: REST POST /api/admin/reviews/{id}/moderation (decision, reason, If-Match)
    G->>R: REST request + actor assertion (after forward-auth, ADMIN capability)
    Note over R: Local DB transaction: apply decision (HIDE or REMOVE<br/>makes the whole review and its reply non-public),<br/>resolve flags, write audit row, outbox row review.moderated
    R-->>AD: 200 review with new visibility
    R-)Q: AMQP publish review.moderated (to review author and every flag reporter)
    Q-)N: AMQP deliver event
    end

    rect rgb(240, 250, 240)
    Note over S,R: Phase 5 · Public rating summary (computed on read, nothing stored)
    S->>G: REST GET /api/discovery/tutors (search)
    G->>T: REST request
    T->>R: gRPC getRatingSummaries (subject ids)
    Note over R: Count only PUBLIC reviews, average and 1 to 5 distribution
    R-->>T: average (null if none), reviewCount, distribution
    T-->>S: 200 tutors with ratings
    end
